---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
	title="Wholesale Bakery Vancouver | HACCP-Certified | Sula"
	description="HACCP-certified wholesale bakery in Vancouver. Up to 300 sandwiches per service, specialty coffee blends, plus keto, vegan, and gluten-free options."
	canonical="/wholesale"
	ogImage="/uploads/2026/02/wholesale-bakery-Vancouver.webp"
	breadcrumbs={[
		{ name: 'Home', url: '/' },
		{ name: 'Wholesale', url: '/wholesale' }
	]}
>

	<section class="hero">
		<div class="hero-content">
			<span class="eyebrow-italic">Wholesale & Bulk</span>
			<h1>Wholesale baking,<br/><em>built to scale.</em></h1>
			<div class="premium-divider">
				<div class="pd-thin"></div>
				<div class="pd-thick"></div>
				<div class="pd-diamond"></div>
				<div class="pd-thick"></div>
				<div class="pd-thin-r"></div>
			</div>
			<p class="hero-tagline">HACCP-certified production. Premium ingredients. Up to 300 sandwiches and soup portions per service. A dependable wholesale partner for businesses, offices, and retail.</p>
			<div class="hero-buttons">
				<a href="/contact" class="cta">
					<span class="cta-badge">
						<img src="/uploads/2025/09/sula-cafe-logo-2026.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</span>
					Wholesale Inquiry
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section-cream-reverse reveal">
		<div class="two-col container">
			<div class="two-col-img cocoa">
				<img src="/uploads/2025/12/wholesale-bakery-Vancouver.webp" alt="Sula Café wholesale bakery Vancouver HACCP-certified production" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
				<div class="pattern-overlay pattern-block"></div>
				<div class="two-col-img-frame"></div>
			</div>
			<div class="two-col-content">
				<span class="eyebrow-italic">HACCP-Certified Kitchen</span>
				<h2>Quality at <em>scale.</em></h2>
				<div class="mini-divider">
					<div class="m-line"></div>
					<div class="m-diamond"></div>
					<div class="m-line"></div>
				</div>
				<p>Our bakery is equipped to support wholesale and bulk baking for businesses, offices, and retail partners seeking high-quality, thoughtfully prepared baked goods. All production takes place in our HACCP-certified kitchen, with strict food safety standards, consistency, and reliability at every stage.</p>
				<p>Small, controlled batches using premium ingredients. Freshness and flavour even at scale. Regular production, one-time bulk orders, or customized assortments. We offer flexible solutions rooted in quality and care. See the <a href="/menu" class="body-link">full Sula Café menu</a> for what we bake every morning.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section-cocoa reveal">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="intro-block">
				<span class="eyebrow-italic" style="color:var(--burnt-light)">Capacity & Customization</span>
				<h2>Built for <em>business needs.</em></h2>
				<div class="premium-divider premium-divider-dark">
					<div class="pd-thin"></div>
					<div class="pd-thick"></div>
					<div class="pd-diamond"></div>
					<div class="pd-thick"></div>
					<div class="pd-thin-r"></div>
				</div>
				<p>From regular daily production to large one-time orders. Tailored to your dietary requirements and brand standards.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="card-grid-3" style="margin-top:60px">
				<div class="card reveal delay-100">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img cocoa">
						<div class="pattern-overlay pattern-star"></div>
						<span class="card-img-label">300+</span>
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">High Capacity</span>
						<h3>Sandwich & Soup <em>Production</em></h3>
						<p>Up to 300 sandwiches and soup portions per service. Reliable for breakfast or lunch programs.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="card reveal delay-200">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img espresso">
						<div class="pattern-overlay pattern-jaali"></div>
						<span class="card-img-label">Custom</span>
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Dietary Options</span>
						<h3>Keto, Vegan, <em>Gluten-Free</em></h3>
						<p>Specialized batches available on request. Tailored to dietary needs without compromising on flavour.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="card reveal delay-300">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img tan">
						<div class="pattern-overlay pattern-wave"></div>
						<span class="card-img-label">Flexible</span>
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Reliable Partner</span>
						<h3>Regular & <em>One-Time Orders</em></h3>
						<p>Daily production schedules or one-off bulk orders. Customized assortments to match your brand.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section-cream-deep reveal" id="faq">
		<div class="container container-narrow">
			<div class="intro-block">
				<span class="eyebrow-italic">Wholesale Questions</span>
				<h2>Common questions <em>from wholesale partners.</em></h2>
				<div class="premium-divider">
					<div class="pd-thin"></div>
					<div class="pd-thick"></div>
					<div class="pd-diamond"></div>
					<div class="pd-thick"></div>
					<div class="pd-thin-r"></div>
				</div>
				<p>What partners ask before getting started.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="faq-list">
				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>
						<span class="faq-q">What's the minimum wholesale order?</span>
						<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
					</summary>
					<div class="faq-a">
						<p>Varies by product. Pastries start at 24 units. Chai concentrates at 4 litres. Reach out and we'll match you to a starting plan.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>
						<span class="faq-q">Can you do custom items?</span>
						<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
					</summary>
					<div class="faq-a">
						<p>Yes. Keto, gluten-free, and vegan items can be made to order. We also create custom assortments for cafés and offices.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>
						<span class="faq-q">Are you HACCP certified?</span>
						<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
					</summary>
					<div class="faq-a">
						<p>Yes. All production happens in our HACCP-certified kitchen. Strict food safety standards at every stage.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>
						<span class="faq-q">How much can you produce per day?</span>
						<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
					</summary>
					<div class="faq-a">
						<p>Up to 300 sandwiches and soup portions for breakfast or lunch service. Higher volumes possible with notice.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>
						<span class="faq-q">How does delivery work?</span>
						<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
					</summary>
					<div class="faq-a">
						<p>Daily delivery available across Vancouver. Bulk orders coordinated with your team's preferred schedule.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>
						<span class="faq-q">Can I see samples first?</span>
						<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
					</summary>
					<div class="faq-a">
						<p>Always. We send sample boxes to potential wholesale partners. Tell us your business and we'll set it up.</p>
					</div>
				</details>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<script type="application/ld+json" slot="schema" set:html={JSON.stringify({
		"@context": "https://schema.org",
		"@type": "FAQPage",
		"mainEntity": [
			{ "@type": "Question", "name": "What's the minimum wholesale order?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Varies by product. Pastries start at 24 units. Chai concentrates at 4 litres. Reach out and we'll match you to a starting plan." } },
			{ "@type": "Question", "name": "Can you do custom items?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Keto, gluten-free, and vegan items can be made to order. We also create custom assortments for cafés and offices." } },
			{ "@type": "Question", "name": "Are you HACCP certified?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. All production happens in our HACCP-certified kitchen. Strict food safety standards at every stage." } },
			{ "@type": "Question", "name": "How much can you produce per day?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Up to 300 sandwiches and soup portions for breakfast or lunch service. Higher volumes possible with notice." } },
			{ "@type": "Question", "name": "How does delivery work?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Daily delivery available across Vancouver. Bulk orders coordinated with your team's preferred schedule." } },
			{ "@type": "Question", "name": "Can I see samples first?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Always. We send sample boxes to potential wholesale partners. Tell us your business and we'll set it up." } }
		]
	})} />

	<section class="section section-espresso reveal">
		<div class="container text-center">
			<span class="eyebrow-italic">Wholesale Inquiry</span>
			<h2>Ready to <em>partner with us?</em></h2>
			<div class="premium-divider premium-divider-dark">
				<div class="pd-thin"></div>
				<div class="pd-thick"></div>
				<div class="pd-diamond"></div>
				<div class="pd-thick"></div>
				<div class="pd-thin-r"></div>
			</div>
			<p style="max-width:620px;margin:24px auto 36px">Tell us your volume, dietary requirements, and timeline. We'll prepare a custom proposal and pricing within 48 hours.</p>
			<a href="/contact" class="cta">
				<span class="cta-badge">
					<img src="/uploads/2025/09/sula-cafe-logo-2026.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
				</span>
				Wholesale Inquiry
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>

</Layout>
